              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൈവെള്ള (kaiveḷḷa) is native Dravidian, \"the white of the hand\": kai, \"hand\" (DEDR 2023), and veḷḷa, \"white\" (DEDR 5496, with Tamil veḷ). The palm is the paler side of the hand."
